  "title": "DEV screenshot capture (2026-09-28, redesign reference: 'make sure visually it matches more closely with the other screens from the same phone'): the game's own phone apps (BizMan, MyEmployees, Contacts + two conversations, Rivals, EconoView, Persona) opened through SmartphoneUI.OpenApp like their icons; then our Business page (Transfers / Loans / Permissions) empty and with 12 LOCAL sample rows per list; then the floating chat window empty, with 40 LOCAL lines (two long wrapped ones), scrolled back, and at a small size. 'screenshot hub-<view>' captures each on the host. Host + 1 client on save1 (a real second player exists). Sample rows are display-only (never sent, never saved) and cleared at the end. Run at two sizes: normal, and BAMP_RIG_WINDOW=1280x720.",
  "preconditions": "Dev build with the phoneapp / hubview / chatview / contactopen / uifill levers (TestDrive.cs). Fixture save1 (host melaus, client Client1). Keep the host window unfocused but NOT minimised (a minimised window does not render).",
